<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοριστ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be indeterminate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				941b26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be without definite ideas, uncertain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.48K.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, Asp <i><span class="en">
				<u>in EN</u>
				74.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be immoderate,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχεσθαι
				ὅρου καὶ μέτρου,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				465
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
